= Typorium
Simple browser based on #link("https://typst.app/")[typst] instead of html.

A browser is just a renderer deployed on the
user machine whose data is fetched from the cloud.
This browser uses typst as the rendering engine and
pdf as the rendering target.

Really just a personal toy to test my thinking of a browser.

== Help

- Enter a valid url in text field in toolbar
- Hit Go: "▶️"
